      "message": "1. Question: What does it mean for passing an empty proxy?\n2. Not for this CL, if empty and null mean the same thing, is it better if we change proxtInfo to empty object internally and use proxyInfo.isEmpty() everywhere instead of proxyInfo !\u003d null to make our life easier?",
